#: inc/faq-section.php:20
msgid "Does this replace legal counsel?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/faq-section.php:21
msgid "No. The platform reduces risk and manual work by embedding compliance into day-to-day operations, but it does not replace legal advice."
msgstr ""

#: inc/faq-section.php:24
msgid "Can compliance really be centralized globally?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/faq-section.php:25
msgid "Yes. Policies, worker data, and required actions are tracked in one platform so teams see the same source of truth across countries."
msgstr ""

#: inc/faq-section.php:28
msgid "Where do compliance insights live?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/faq-section.php:29
msgid "Insights appear in dashboards and worker profiles, with alerts when regulations or employment status changes require action."
msgstr ""

#: inc/faq-section.php:32
msgid "How are complex or edge cases handled?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/faq-section.php:33
msgid "Edge cases are flagged for review with context and documentation so legal and HR teams can resolve them without losing track."
msgstr ""

#: inc/faq-section.php:36
msgid "How does the platform help prevent worker misclassification?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/faq-section.php:37
msgid "Classification checks, contract templates, and audit trails help teams hire with the right worker type from the start."
msgstr ""

